# Content vs SEO

**Site copy:** Use only what Brian adds to `docs/knowledge/` or supplies in chat. Clean wording. Do not invent facts.

**SEO files in `docs/seo/`:** Use to choose audiences, keyword groups, and page order. Do not paste research onto the homepage.

**Build order:** Improve a matching existing URL first. Lead with consulting (homepage), project management (`/services/land-development-project-management/`), then create the subdivision page. Then feasibility, entitlements, multifamily, then inland markets.

**After creating a page:** Recommend the next unused row in `docs/seo/page-order.md`. One page per keyword group. No thin city pages. No partnership copy unless Brian offers it.
